# This project needs no environment variables to run.
#
# `pnpm install && pnpm dev` works with no .env file at all. Content is
# local (static repositories + MDX via Velite); there are no external
# APIs, databases, or secrets.
#
# The two variables below are optional escape hatches for the asset
# generation scripts. Uncomment only if you need them.

# Skip OG image generation during `pnpm build` / `pnpm og:generate`.
# Useful when iterating on the build without regenerating images.
# SKIP_OG_BUILD=1

# Port for the throwaway production server that `pnpm resume:pdf` boots
# to render /resume. Change only if 4756 is already in use.
# RESUME_PDF_PORT=4756
